## Events Leading to Crash

System was connected to AP d8:b3:70:f8:89:4f. Roaming triggered disconnect/
reconnect to same AP. Association was rejected temporarily multiple times
(status=30), then timed out. During this state, MCU messages began timing
out, triggering firmware reset recovery which crashed due to NULL vif pointer.

